  "title": "The atom rule for every knot sphere",
  "status": "Proved",
  "claim": "For every octahedral knot sphere K_k (k >= 2) with separated Fano atoms: each atom acts as its line in exactly one of the four classes of its own handle; all atoms acting leaves no state satisfying every line; otherwise every acting atom holds a unit in its region in every state satisfying every line. Proved computer-assisted: a homology decomposition and a locality lemma by hand, a finite local check on 2,700 splices (every line of K_5-K_7, orbits of K_2-K_4) and a classification of line neighbourhoods (four types over K_2-K_8, none new beyond K_3).",
